(4077047, 584502, 68797, '<td valign="top">when I flipped through the thumbs before starting to vote, I noticed this one. I tried to figure out what the small trangle thing at the top is. the dark is just way too dark to make out what is what. after the candy the, what seems to be a skirt or dress, should form a bum right? but because of the light there is no rounding of a bum. the light om the legs is too bright, and I don''t know what you did to smooth the skin but it looks all blotty and uneven. legs are too dark as well. I''m sorry I can''t be more positive.</td>', 'when I flipped through the thumbs before starting to vote, I noticed this one. I tried to figure out what the small trangle thing at the top is. the dark is just way too dark to make out what is what. after the candy the, what seems to be a skirt or dress, should form a bum right? but because of the light there is no rounding of a bum. the light om the legs is too bright, and I don''t know what you did to smooth the skin but it looks all blotty and uneven. legs are too dark as well. I''m sorry I can''t be more positive.', '2007-09-10 06:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
