(4077147, 582492, 82503, '<td valign="top">You see, this is exactly the problem. I like this picture, I really do. In another challenge, I would have given it a 7 or even an 8. But in the candy challenge where the description says "Satisfy your sweet tooth by photographing candy." this is just too much of a stretch. So DNMC -&gt; 4.</td>', 'You see, this is exactly the problem. I like this picture, I really do. In another challenge, I would have given it a 7 or even an 8. But in the candy challenge where the description says "Satisfy your sweet tooth by photographing candy." this is just too much of a stretch. So DNMC -> 4.', '2007-09-10 07:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4077148, 584584, 78062, '<td valign="top">Looks a hair out of focus... nice colours though, some soothing tones of brown. Maybe a tiny bit more contrast would have helped and for some reason I am thinking of this is soft focus with some steam rising from the mug...</td>', 'Looks a hair out of focus... nice colours though, some soothing tones of brown. Maybe a tiny bit more contrast would have helped and for some reason I am thinking of this is soft focus with some steam rising from the mug...', '2007-09-10 07:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
