(4077156, 584304, 78062, '<td valign="top">Needs a boost in contrast to give it the edge. Great focus though and the exposure is fine, it''s just a little dull. Maybe some more saturation would help you out? And even though there is no definitive subject, I kinda like it and i can see it in a nursery or something.</td>', 'Needs a boost in contrast to give it the edge. Great focus though and the exposure is fine, it''s just a little dull. Maybe some more saturation would help you out? And even though there is no definitive subject, I kinda like it and i can see it in a nursery or something.', '2007-09-10 07:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4077157, 584511, 68797, '<td valign="top">nice idea. il ike the angle and shot.</td>', 'nice idea. il ike the angle and shot.', '2007-09-10 07:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4077159, 584754, 68797, '<td valign="top">the colors are nice, the idea is a bit simple</td>', 'the colors are nice, the idea is a bit simple', '2007-09-10 07:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4077161, 584502, 78062, '<td valign="top">Could be nice but the top her leg is so bright it makes her leg look a little distorted. Also theres a few jaggies near the bottom of her legs where i think the blur effect ran out. The more I look at it the stranger the bottom of the legs look, and those little spots distract my eye and could be fixed. I thought it was dirt on my monitor at first.<br/> <br/>A nice pic but could be great.</td>', 'Could be nice but the top her leg is so bright it makes her leg look a little distorted. Also theres a few jaggies near the bottom of her legs where i think the blur effect ran out. The more I look at it the stranger the bottom of the legs look, and those little spots distract my eye and could be fixed. I thought it was dirt on my monitor at first. A nice pic but could be great.', '2007-09-10 07:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4077164, 584665, 68797, '<td valign="top">good lighting, no blown parts. i like the choice of bg.</td>', 'good lighting, no blown parts. i like the choice of bg.', '2007-09-10 07:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4077165, 584215, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, maybe needs a touch more contrast to seperate the pieces, and the raft seems a little dark. But i like its playfulness and composition. You get extra marks for imagination also.</td>', 'Nice idea, maybe needs a touch more contrast to seperate the pieces, and the raft seems a little dark. But i like its playfulness and composition. You get extra marks for imagination also.', '2007-09-10 07:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
