(4078269, 583667, 73235, '<td valign="top">good imagination, unfortunately some technical details let this picture down.<br/>Here are a few: even what you wanted in focus, is not. the background (tree) is a good idea as a relation to the apple, but it''s not filling all the way to the right side. no text in the picture (date stam of your camera). On the good side: you followed the rules of thirds, lighting is good, no washed out areas, you got colors in your picture.</td>', 'good imagination, unfortunately some technical details let this picture down.Here are a few: even what you wanted in focus, is not. the background (tree) is a good idea as a relation to the apple, but it''s not filling all the way to the right side. no text in the picture (date stam of your camera). On the good side: you followed the rules of thirds, lighting is good, no washed out areas, you got colors in your picture.', '2007-09-10 14:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
