(4080336, 584387, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool candy choice - the colors and placement are actually pretty interesting.  the thing that really jumps out at me is the level of noise - the background is not smooth at all.  second, the lighting, color balance seems a bit off - maybe a bit too much yellow as evidenced by the not-white white bear.</td>', 'cool candy choice - the colors and placement are actually pretty interesting.  the thing that really jumps out at me is the level of noise - the background is not smooth at all.  second, the lighting, color balance seems a bit off - maybe a bit too much yellow as evidenced by the not-white white bear.', '2007-09-11 07:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080339, 584716, 67152, '<td valign="top">set up like a advert is a good idea but the oversaturated blues really take away from that feel.  in addition, the choice of rectangular cropping doesn''t seem to work here - a square crop or wider crop to include the corner of the wrapper on the left may have helped</td>', 'set up like a advert is a good idea but the oversaturated blues really take away from that feel.  in addition, the choice of rectangular cropping doesn''t seem to work here - a square crop or wider crop to include the corner of the wrapper on the left may have helped', '2007-09-11 07:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080341, 584765, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the set up of this - the shallow DOF works well to highlight all the tootsie rolls and merchandise available, but the image seems a bit underexposed</td>', 'i like the set up of this - the shallow DOF works well to highlight all the tootsie rolls and merchandise available, but the image seems a bit underexposed', '2007-09-11 07:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080353, 583523, 67152, '<td valign="top">interesting idea by lighting the rock candy from underneath - but the top of the image seems so dark.  I almost think a square crop on the lower part of the image would come off better</td>', 'interesting idea by lighting the rock candy from underneath - but the top of the image seems so dark.  I almost think a square crop on the lower part of the image would come off better', '2007-09-11 07:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
