(4080361, 581200, 67152, '<td valign="top">funny idea - but the lighting seems very harsh, the cell phone and remote seem remarkably out of place.  And to be honest - the background looks more like a rug on a floor than a couch.</td>', 'funny idea - but the lighting seems very harsh, the cell phone and remote seem remarkably out of place.  And to be honest - the background looks more like a rug on a floor than a couch.', '2007-09-11 07:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
