(4080366, 581880, 67152, '<td valign="top">not a great title to get me inspired...the exposure seems a little harsh, the angle seems a little too low and the subject is not remarkably interesting 4</td>', 'not a great title to get me inspired...the exposure seems a little harsh, the angle seems a little too low and the subject is not remarkably interesting 4', '2007-09-11 07:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
