(4080387, 582919, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool idea - very simple and effective. i see a couple of areas that prevent this image from really scoring well.  First, the image seems oversharpened - noticeble on the left side of the lollipop.  Second, the image seems to have seen dodged quite a bit on the pot and background in the lower sections of the photo.  Third, the lollipop seems a bit pixelated</td>', 'cool idea - very simple and effective. i see a couple of areas that prevent this image from really scoring well.  First, the image seems oversharpened - noticeble on the left side of the lollipop.  Second, the image seems to have seen dodged quite a bit on the pot and background in the lower sections of the photo.  Third, the lollipop seems a bit pixelated', '2007-09-11 08:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080481, 584212, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the stop action feel of this.  however, the uneven lighting hurts the image - especially the dark line in the middle</td>', 'i like the stop action feel of this.  however, the uneven lighting hurts the image - especially the dark line in the middle', '2007-09-11 08:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
