(4080621, 584720, 41675, '<td valign="top">With better focus and less "gray grain" on some of the warheads (red one, back left and green one, right front), I would have scored this better. I do like your idea though.</td>', 'With better focus and less "gray grain" on some of the warheads (red one, back left and green one, right front), I would have scored this better. I do like your idea though.', '2007-09-11 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
