(4080627, 584509, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your border is very overpowering to your image. Also, I''m not sure the grain works well for this image. I do like the idea/concept behind your image.</td>', 'For me, your border is very overpowering to your image. Also, I''m not sure the grain works well for this image. I do like the idea/concept behind your image.', '2007-09-11 10:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
