(4080637, 582492, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice cat closeup, but going by the challenge guidelines of "satisfy your sweet tooth," I have chosen to give your image a lower score. If it were in a pet challenge, I would have scored it much higher. I really do like the eye and composition.</td>', 'It''s a nice cat closeup, but going by the challenge guidelines of "satisfy your sweet tooth," I have chosen to give your image a lower score. If it were in a pet challenge, I would have scored it much higher. I really do like the eye and composition.', '2007-09-11 10:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080639, 584473, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice use of repeating shapes. the placemetn of the candy at an angle works well.  i almost feel the image is just a little close cropped on the top of the imag - I would like to see more of teh kissables rather than the smarties</td>', 'nice use of repeating shapes. the placemetn of the candy at an angle works well.  i almost feel the image is just a little close cropped on the top of the imag - I would like to see more of teh kissables rather than the smarties', '2007-09-11 10:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080641, 584740, 41675, '<td valign="top">A bit too minimalistic for my personal tastes. The graininess of the background and the candy itself seems blown out.</td>', 'A bit too minimalistic for my personal tastes. The graininess of the background and the candy itself seems blown out.', '2007-09-11 10:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
