(4080647, 583667, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, with a bit more focus on the apple itself, I would have scored it higher. Also, I think the rules state not to have the dates show up on your images. You will want to change that on your camera setting. I do like the idea/concept behind your image though.</td>', 'For me, with a bit more focus on the apple itself, I would have scored it higher. Also, I think the rules state not to have the dates show up on your images. You will want to change that on your camera setting. I do like the idea/concept behind your image though.', '2007-09-11 10:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
