(4081484, 584769, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful<br/> <br/>For some reason this work a lot better than any of the other shots where lots of sweets fill the frame.<br/> <br/>Great colours and I love the leading lines that you have created<br/> <br/>Simple yet effective 9</td>', 'Beautiful For some reason this work a lot better than any of the other shots where lots of sweets fill the frame. Great colours and I love the leading lines that you have created Simple yet effective 9', '2007-09-11 16:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081485, 583812, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK, well let me tell you that you have created a wonderful serene and beautiful image, yet tragically (for me) the first thing I thought when I saw this was ''ooooo if she gets crumbs on the bed they will be a nightmare to get out of that cover!!! (I must be getting old!)<br/> <br/>Lovely soft image and great depth of field 8</td>', 'OK, well let me tell you that you have created a wonderful serene and beautiful image, yet tragically (for me) the first thing I thought when I saw this was ''ooooo if she gets crumbs on the bed they will be a nightmare to get out of that cover!!! (I must be getting old!) Lovely soft image and great depth of field 8', '2007-09-11 16:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081486, 584581, 68035, '<td valign="top">Goodness, when I opened this the first thing I thought of was that it was an out and out copy of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=502377" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/671/120/502377.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/671/120/502377.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/671/120/502377.jpg"/></a> from the ''bubbles'' challenge.  Fortunately I checked it and see that it is a completely different composition with a similar subject matter<br/> <br/>I am guessing you have used real gum which has the advantage of letting you see the blowers lips but has created a couple of nasty light spots<br/> <br/>If I was being very pedantic then I might suggest cloning out the hairs which stand out from the white background.  Having said that, great fun entry well executed 8</td>', 'Goodness, when I opened this the first thing I thought of was that it was an out and out copy of  from the ''bubbles'' challenge.  Fortunately I checked it and see that it is a completely different composition with a similar subject matter I am guessing you have used real gum which has the advantage of letting you see the blowers lips but has created a couple of nasty light spots If I was being very pedantic then I might suggest cloning out the hairs which stand out from the white background.  Having said that, great fun entry well executed 8', '2007-09-11 16:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081487, 584264, 68035, '<td valign="top">Fantastic macro and great dof.  Terrific colours and I like the effect that keeping the wrappers on has had.  The blue backdrop works well too 8</td>', 'Fantastic macro and great dof.  Terrific colours and I like the effect that keeping the wrappers on has had.  The blue backdrop works well too 8', '2007-09-11 16:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081489, 584341, 68035, '<td valign="top">made me laugh out loud<br/> <br/>Funny idea and more importantly very well executed 8</td>', 'made me laugh out loud Funny idea and more importantly very well executed 8', '2007-09-11 16:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081490, 584773, 68035, '<td valign="top">Green lips?  How about green with envy.  Wonderful desat and I love the sharpness of the candy crystals and mouth compared with the softness of the face.  Oustanding</td>', 'Green lips?  How about green with envy.  Wonderful desat and I love the sharpness of the candy crystals and mouth compared with the softness of the face.  Oustanding', '2007-09-11 16:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081491, 584698, 68035, '<td valign="top">Strangely appealling, a very nice blend of humour and style, the harsh white backdrop sets this off to a T</td>', 'Strangely appealling, a very nice blend of humour and style, the harsh white backdrop sets this off to a T', '2007-09-11 16:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081492, 584515, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the bowl of M&amp;M''s idea.  Makes for a picture that draws the viewer in on a number of levels</td>', 'Very nice take on the bowl of M&M''s idea.  Makes for a picture that draws the viewer in on a number of levels', '2007-09-11 16:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081494, 584764, 68035, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning macro and perhaps my favourite picture of M&amp;M''s in the whole challenge.  Very simple idea but wonderfully executed</td>', 'Absolutely stunning macro and perhaps my favourite picture of M&M''s in the whole challenge.  Very simple idea but wonderfully executed', '2007-09-11 16:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081495, 584137, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oooooo I REALLY dont like ''Woody'' pictures so this must be a brilliant one to have made me laugh out loud the way it did<br/> <br/>Funny but wrong (but funny will always win out 7)</td>', 'Oooooo I REALLY dont like ''Woody'' pictures so this must be a brilliant one to have made me laugh out loud the way it did Funny but wrong (but funny will always win out 7)', '2007-09-11 16:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081496, 583609, 68035, '<td valign="top">Thats just gross...And very very funny...and really well executed 7</td>', 'Thats just gross...And very very funny...and really well executed 7', '2007-09-11 16:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081498, 583931, 68035, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice focus and dof in the execution 7</td>', 'Good idea and nice focus and dof in the execution 7', '2007-09-11 16:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081499, 584385, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ooooooo nice DOF and I love the bokeh (especially as it is not too accentuated and the person in the background adds to the image in a great way....Fantastic tongue)<br/> <br/>I do wonder whether any voters will be pedantic enough to say that ''cake is not candy''...If they do ignore them completely<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Ooooooo nice DOF and I love the bokeh (especially as it is not too accentuated and the person in the background adds to the image in a great way....Fantastic tongue) I do wonder whether any voters will be pedantic enough to say that ''cake is not candy''...If they do ignore them completely 7', '2007-09-11 16:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081502, 582239, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great use of colours which are all very complimentary.  Not sure why but for some reason the DOF seems a tad off (though having said that I should emphasise it is a way better portrait than I could take)</td>', 'Great use of colours which are all very complimentary.  Not sure why but for some reason the DOF seems a tad off (though having said that I should emphasise it is a way better portrait than I could take)', '2007-09-11 16:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081505, 584365, 68035, '<td valign="top">Hate the title love the photo (which to be honest is absolutely the right way round to get it)<br/> <br/>Superb desat and a very cool portrait</td>', 'Hate the title love the photo (which to be honest is absolutely the right way round to get it) Superb desat and a very cool portrait', '2007-09-11 16:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081506, 583481, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love the harsh white background and the fact that even achiving this you have not had any issues with blow out on the wrapper.  Lovely minimalism and a super title</td>', 'I love the harsh white background and the fact that even achiving this you have not had any issues with blow out on the wrapper.  Lovely minimalism and a super title', '2007-09-11 16:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081507, 583144, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great desat and overall the image looks as if it could be used in an advert for malteasers.  Has a slightly dreamlike quality about it</td>', 'Great desat and overall the image looks as if it could be used in an advert for malteasers.  Has a slightly dreamlike quality about it', '2007-09-11 16:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081508, 584570, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea and composition, may have prefered it with a deeper dof.  Super job though</td>', 'Lovely idea and composition, may have prefered it with a deeper dof.  Super job though', '2007-09-11 16:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081509, 584749, 68035, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, love the contrast between the tightly focused beans in the glass and those falling from the sky.  Super colours throughout</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, love the contrast between the tightly focused beans in the glass and those falling from the sky.  Super colours throughout', '2007-09-11 16:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081510, 582919, 68035, '<td valign="top">Clever, simple and beautiful</td>', 'Clever, simple and beautiful', '2007-09-11 16:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081514, 583667, 68035, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic idea, for me if the dof had been deep or you had got the apple sharp and shay slighty oof this would have been a ribbon winner<br/> <br/>I think you may also suffer for having the date stamp on the picture<br/> <br/>Fun image, well done</td>', 'What a fantastic idea, for me if the dof had been deep or you had got the apple sharp and shay slighty oof this would have been a ribbon winner I think you may also suffer for having the date stamp on the picture Fun image, well done', '2007-09-11 16:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081515, 583804, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting and different shot although I do wonder whether his health and hygiene certificate is up too date.  Possibly could have done with a slightly deeper DOF to bring (what I guess is) the chocolate slightly more integral to the shot</td>', 'Interesting and different shot although I do wonder whether his health and hygiene certificate is up too date.  Possibly could have done with a slightly deeper DOF to bring (what I guess is) the chocolate slightly more integral to the shot', '2007-09-11 16:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081517, 584715, 68035, '<td valign="top">Much to like about this photo although two minor points (imo) maybe mean that it is a very good but not a great image...the dof seems slightly out and I think I would have prefered it sharper on the two chocoaltes ate the front.  Secondly the glass on the right seems a touch anomalous and distracting.  Still a good entry for the challenge though</td>', 'Much to like about this photo although two minor points (imo) maybe mean that it is a very good but not a great image...the dof seems slightly out and I think I would have prefered it sharper on the two chocoaltes ate the front.  Secondly the glass on the right seems a touch anomalous and distracting.  Still a good entry for the challenge though', '2007-09-11 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081551, 584742, 67152, '<td valign="top">these treats sound incredibly good! - the image has some nice details too it but I wonder if it needs a little white balance adjustment.</td>', 'these treats sound incredibly good! - the image has some nice details too it but I wonder if it needs a little white balance adjustment.', '2007-09-11 16:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081552, 584515, 84087, '<td valign="top">wonderful</td>', 'wonderful', '2007-09-11 16:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081558, 584521, 67152, '<td valign="top">cute idea.  the set up is well done and the colors are pretty good and the lighting isn''t bad but the focus is far too soft - both the cars and the m&amp;ms don''t seem tack sharp</td>', 'cute idea.  the set up is well done and the colors are pretty good and the lighting isn''t bad but the focus is far too soft - both the cars and the m&ms don''t seem tack sharp', '2007-09-11 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081561, 584120, 67152, '<td valign="top">the focus on the face is really good.  i think you did a good job with b/w conversion here - but I really think candy comes off much better in color</td>', 'the focus on the face is really good.  i think you did a good job with b/w conversion here - but I really think candy comes off much better in color', '2007-09-11 16:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081562, 583667, 67152, '<td valign="top">very cute idea- the date in the upper left really needs to go!  the focus is a little soft and the image could use a better background, a little boost of brightness and contrast as well</td>', 'very cute idea- the date in the upper left really needs to go!  the focus is a little soft and the image could use a better background, a little boost of brightness and contrast as well', '2007-09-11 16:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081565, 583694, 84087, '<td valign="top">wonderful</td>', 'wonderful', '2007-09-11 16:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081570, 584509, 67152, '<td valign="top">interesting choice of processing - the composition is actually pretty interesting (good angle) and the grain clearly adds to the feel of the image but I overall it is not very appealing to me</td>', 'interesting choice of processing - the composition is actually pretty interesting (good angle) and the grain clearly adds to the feel of the image but I overall it is not very appealing to me', '2007-09-11 16:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081577, 584215, 67152, '<td valign="top">good concept shot - the raft, the bears, the whales/sharks - but the lighting seems off (underexposed)</td>', 'good concept shot - the raft, the bears, the whales/sharks - but the lighting seems off (underexposed)', '2007-09-11 16:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081588, 583608, 67152, '<td valign="top">the layers of color and texture are actually quite interesting and the title is very well thought out - back for a comment and a bump</td>', 'the layers of color and texture are actually quite interesting and the title is very well thought out - back for a comment and a bump', '2007-09-11 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081601, 584481, 67152, '<td valign="top">good sharp image - but there are several areas that don''t quite work in my opinion.  <br/> <br/>first, there is too much clutter - why is a gingerbread man in the photo?  what is the brown stuff in the background?   DPC photographs usually work better when the image is simpler - less stuff means better scores <br/> <br/>second, the background creates lighting issues - a dark background like this really makes the image seem underexposed.  <br/> <br/>Third, a recrop of the image to focus only on the frog candy would really boost the shot.  the candies are pretty good and well photographed - take advantage of that...</td>', 'good sharp image - but there are several areas that don''t quite work in my opinion.   first, there is too much clutter - why is a gingerbread man in the photo?  what is the brown stuff in the background?   DPC photographs usually work better when the image is simpler - less stuff means better scores  second, the background creates lighting issues - a dark background like this really makes the image seem underexposed.   Third, a recrop of the image to focus only on the frog candy would really boost the shot.  the candies are pretty good and well photographed - take advantage of that...', '2007-09-11 16:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081631, 584291, 75898, '<td valign="top">That looks very tasty!</td>', 'That looks very tasty!', '2007-09-11 16:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081648, 584657, 65125, '<td valign="top">I like the idea! However, the image is noisy. The lightning could be better also.</td>', 'I like the idea! However, the image is noisy. The lightning could be better also.', '2007-09-11 17:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4081650, 584215, 75898, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty funny!  Poor gummy bears...</td>', 'That''s pretty funny!  Poor gummy bears...', '2007-09-11 17:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
