(4082828, 584658, 37104, '<td valign="top">Cool setup. It''s very bright though... a little blown out.</td>', 'Cool setup. It''s very bright though... a little blown out.', '2007-09-12 00:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082837, 584204, 29011, '<td valign="top">Elegant lighting and presentation :)<br/>Only nitpick may be the walnut in the chocolate. It''s kind of distracting in the composition. Perhaps seeing the bottom bar partially immersed(just a tad, to give that cool effect that the walnut has) would be perfect. Overall this is very nicely done.<br/> <br/>Coming back to this again, I quite like the shadow cast of the chocolate bar on the melted chocolate.</td>', 'Elegant lighting and presentation :)Only nitpick may be the walnut in the chocolate. It''s kind of distracting in the composition. Perhaps seeing the bottom bar partially immersed(just a tad, to give that cool effect that the walnut has) would be perfect. Overall this is very nicely done. Coming back to this again, I quite like the shadow cast of the chocolate bar on the melted chocolate.', '2007-09-12 00:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082844, 584740, 37104, '<td valign="top">Minimalistic, nice. But it doesn''t catch much interest. I appreciate the idea, but I don''t think it will fare so well...</td>', 'Minimalistic, nice. But it doesn''t catch much interest. I appreciate the idea, but I don''t think it will fare so well...', '2007-09-12 00:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
