(4084062, 584493, 67579, '<td valign="top">Doh, I feel so sorry for those little guys :(  should have sacrificed the smarties and saved the good stuff LOL, not overly fond of the blueish water but nice creative shot.<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Doh, I feel so sorry for those little guys :(  should have sacrificed the smarties and saved the good stuff LOL, not overly fond of the blueish water but nice creative shot. -dave', '2007-09-12 10:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084063, 584325, 67579, '<td valign="top">good idea, nice scene but just IMHO the orange is just seems a touch over saturated. Good job though :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'good idea, nice scene but just IMHO the orange is just seems a touch over saturated. Good job though :) -dave', '2007-09-12 10:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084075, 583609, 67579, '<td valign="top">Been there done that, I love M&amp;M''s. Great sence of ha ha and great pic, nice one :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Been there done that, I love M&M''s. Great sence of ha ha and great pic, nice one :) -dave', '2007-09-12 10:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084089, 583448, 67579, '<td valign="top">IMHO this is a great photo but I think the BG mite hurt it a bit as it just feels hard and cold to me, maybe a yellow or orange BG with a soft spot on it for texture IMO mite have kicked it up a but. I like it either way and going to kick it up a notch on the score board as I like it more the second time around.<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'IMHO this is a great photo but I think the BG mite hurt it a bit as it just feels hard and cold to me, maybe a yellow or orange BG with a soft spot on it for texture IMO mite have kicked it up a but. I like it either way and going to kick it up a notch on the score board as I like it more the second time around. -dave', '2007-09-12 10:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084104, 584511, 67579, '<td valign="top">Great setup and idea but feel the flash mite be hurting it a bit as it seems a little harsh on the specular highlights and sharp dark shadows. Maybe an extended exposure with out the flash mite have worked a bit better, either way I like it and think it still came out looking great :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Great setup and idea but feel the flash mite be hurting it a bit as it seems a little harsh on the specular highlights and sharp dark shadows. Maybe an extended exposure with out the flash mite have worked a bit better, either way I like it and think it still came out looking great :) -dave', '2007-09-12 11:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084112, 584515, 68642, '<td valign="top">Well isnt this an interesting and creative photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Well isnt this an interesting and creative photo.  Well done.', '2007-09-12 11:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084116, 583743, 67579, '<td valign="top">LOL talk about a sugar overdose, great colours and exposure, seems a tad soft in the focus but still looks great :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'LOL talk about a sugar overdose, great colours and exposure, seems a tad soft in the focus but still looks great :) -dave', '2007-09-12 11:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084126, 584616, 67579, '<td valign="top">Great capture, love the scene and the colours work well together, but IMHO I feel the flash mite hurt it a bit. Maybe a soft incandesent light and an extended exposure mite have helped it a bit IMHO. Good job either way :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Great capture, love the scene and the colours work well together, but IMHO I feel the flash mite hurt it a bit. Maybe a soft incandesent light and an extended exposure mite have helped it a bit IMHO. Good job either way :) -dave', '2007-09-12 11:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
