(4087084, 583667, 67579, '<td valign="top">LOL cute photo, love the expression and well done on putting the gummy worm in the apple, only things that I can see that mite hurt a bit are the date stamp and it seems a little soft in the focus. Personally I like it though, good job :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'LOL cute photo, love the expression and well done on putting the gummy worm in the apple, only things that I can see that mite hurt a bit are the date stamp and it seems a little soft in the focus. Personally I like it though, good job :) -dave', '2007-09-13 10:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087085, 584765, 67579, '<td valign="top">Nice clear macro, a touch dark for my liking but meets challenge well. :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Nice clear macro, a touch dark for my liking but meets challenge well. :) -dave', '2007-09-13 10:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087091, 582932, 67579, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, lighting, focus and exposure are great, green M&amp;M''s almost look like an arrow pointing to the lower left :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Nice macro, lighting, focus and exposure are great, green M&M''s almost look like an arrow pointing to the lower left :) -dave', '2007-09-13 10:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087097, 584749, 67579, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, a little dark IMO. Maybe a low watt soft light mite have worked a  bit better rather than the flash. Great motion blur on the falling beans though . :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Nice photo, a little dark IMO. Maybe a low watt soft light mite have worked a  bit better rather than the flash. Great motion blur on the falling beans though . :) -dave', '2007-09-13 10:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087101, 583526, 67579, '<td valign="top">Nice idea the scene seems to work well and has a nice flow to it, but IMHO a bit over saturated and a little less DOF mite have helped it a bit also.<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Nice idea the scene seems to work well and has a nice flow to it, but IMHO a bit over saturated and a little less DOF mite have helped it a bit also. -dave', '2007-09-13 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087108, 584771, 67579, '<td valign="top">IMHO great idea but the harsh shadows and seemingly tight grasp on the suckers to me look aggressive. Mayby softer a a bit more even lighting would soften the mood of the photo a touch...  Nice work anyway :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'IMHO great idea but the harsh shadows and seemingly tight grasp on the suckers to me look aggressive. Mayby softer a a bit more even lighting would soften the mood of the photo a touch...  Nice work anyway :) -dave', '2007-09-13 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087115, 584315, 67579, '<td valign="top">Great colours and exposure, looks like you used a wide lens on it which I think works very well in this one giving it an interesting perspective.<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Great colours and exposure, looks like you used a wide lens on it which I think works very well in this one giving it an interesting perspective. -dave', '2007-09-13 10:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087121, 582415, 67579, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, colours and exposure lookg good but IMO maby kicking up the contrast and saturation a touch mite help a tad more :)  nice job!<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Nice macro, colours and exposure lookg good but IMO maby kicking up the contrast and saturation a touch mite help a tad more :)  nice job! -dave', '2007-09-13 10:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087129, 584264, 67579, '<td valign="top">Sweet one :) love the colours and the shallow DOF works well in this one. You mite get hammered a bit for the bright specular highlights but I think it works quite well in this one and after looking at it the second time I''m kicking it up another notch :) good job!<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Sweet one :) love the colours and the shallow DOF works well in this one. You mite get hammered a bit for the bright specular highlights but I think it works quite well in this one and after looking at it the second time I''m kicking it up another notch :) good job! -dave', '2007-09-13 11:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087135, 584770, 67579, '<td valign="top">Funny one :) I like it, great sense of ha ha<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Funny one :) I like it, great sense of ha ha -dave', '2007-09-13 11:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087145, 584605, 67579, '<td valign="top">Great colours and good lighting but the flash IMO seems a tad harsh, but on the other ahnd the brown m&amp;m just left of the middle has a bit of a lens flare coming off of it which is kinda cool :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Great colours and good lighting but the flash IMO seems a tad harsh, but on the other ahnd the brown m&m just left of the middle has a bit of a lens flare coming off of it which is kinda cool :) -dave', '2007-09-13 11:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087151, 584096, 67579, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, lighting and exposure are good just IMO a touch more contrast mite have helped a bit :) nice job either way.<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Cute photo, lighting and exposure are good just IMO a touch more contrast mite have helped a bit :) nice job either way. -dave', '2007-09-13 11:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087155, 584706, 67579, '<td valign="top">Wow this one realy jumps out at ya. colours and scene are nice but seeme a touch dark in the mid tones. Nice work though :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Wow this one realy jumps out at ya. colours and scene are nice but seeme a touch dark in the mid tones. Nice work though :) -dave', '2007-09-13 11:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087169, 583804, 67579, '<td valign="top">Im not quite sure what he is making as where I live we dont have any interesting characters like this as they would get shut down in a big hurry as I can see people complaining about health code issues. Anyway Ill assume that he is making some sort of sweets, the overall scene looks great, nice DOF and clarity. Other than his lower right arm has some odd colouring as well as the gloves. Good capture none the less :)<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Im not quite sure what he is making as where I live we dont have any interesting characters like this as they would get shut down in a big hurry as I can see people complaining about health code issues. Anyway Ill assume that he is making some sort of sweets, the overall scene looks great, nice DOF and clarity. Other than his lower right arm has some odd colouring as well as the gloves. Good capture none the less :) -dave', '2007-09-13 11:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087172, 584319, 67579, '<td valign="top">Love the scene looks great but I think bringing the soother in the back a bit more in to focus mite help it a touch more...<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Love the scene looks great but I think bringing the soother in the back a bit more in to focus mite help it a touch more... -dave', '2007-09-13 11:16:02.000000', NULL, 1);
