(4088750, 584122, 18367, '<td valign="top">I have re-read the challenge description and have a great deal of difficulty in  understanding how anyone could "Satisfy their sweet tooth" with this depiction.   While it could be argued that to the fly this is candy, they are not photographers, and as such you would have failed to meet the second portion of the challenge description, that being " by photographing candy".<br/> <br/>The technical aspects of this photo are somewhat wanting, the background is distracting and the composition does leave a great deal to be desired.<br/> <br/>All factors considered, I have no problems telling you that I voted this image a 3.  The image most certainly has a shock value, but not very many other redeeming qualities.</td>', 'I have re-read the challenge description and have a great deal of difficulty in  understanding how anyone could "Satisfy their sweet tooth" with this depiction.   While it could be argued that to the fly this is candy, they are not photographers, and as such you would have failed to meet the second portion of the challenge description, that being " by photographing candy". The technical aspects of this photo are somewhat wanting, the background is distracting and the composition does leave a great deal to be desired. All factors considered, I have no problems telling you that I voted this image a 3.  The image most certainly has a shock value, but not very many other redeeming qualities.', '2007-09-14 01:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
