(4091453, 584654, 67697, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe you did not call this the perfect pair of DPC peeps.  And where''s their cameras?  I''m trying to figure out the odd one lol.  I like how the lighting perfectly enhances the sugar crystals.</td>', 'Can''t believe you did not call this the perfect pair of DPC peeps.  And where''s their cameras?  I''m trying to figure out the odd one lol.  I like how the lighting perfectly enhances the sugar crystals.', '2007-09-15 10:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
