(4092407, 584570, 78021, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this one.  Nice bright colors without being oversaturated (many others in this challange are WAY over saturated) and the glass serface is a nice touch. If the DOF was deep enough to get all of them in focus it would be even better IMHO.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this one.  Nice bright colors without being oversaturated (many others in this challange are WAY over saturated) and the glass serface is a nice touch. If the DOF was deep enough to get all of them in focus it would be even better IMHO.', '2007-09-15 21:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4092415, 584332, 78021, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  How did oyu manage to get everything, even the reflective glass so black and yet the candy so brightly backlit?  Some details about how this one was done would be interesting.  One of my favs. :-)</td>', 'Very cool!  How did oyu manage to get everything, even the reflective glass so black and yet the candy so brightly backlit?  Some details about how this one was done would be interesting.  One of my favs. :-)', '2007-09-15 21:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
