(4092522, 584502, 60862, '<td valign="top">The extreme processing works for me because it leaves the legs as interesting shapes.  But the messiness in the white area to the left of the legs'' bottom is unfortunate.  Not terrible, but something you could''ve cleaned up.</td>', 'The extreme processing works for me because it leaves the legs as interesting shapes.  But the messiness in the white area to the left of the legs'' bottom is unfortunate.  Not terrible, but something you could''ve cleaned up.', '2007-09-15 22:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
