(4092528, 584387, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this isn''t doing it for me for a number of reasons.  The background is very noisy, has JPG compression problems, or both.  The composition seems odd.  The colors are muted.  And the candies are especially sharp.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this isn''t doing it for me for a number of reasons.  The background is very noisy, has JPG compression problems, or both.  The composition seems odd.  The colors are muted.  And the candies are especially sharp.', '2007-09-15 22:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4092530, 582492, 60862, '<td valign="top">Um ... no.  That is, it''s an interesting picture, but it doesn''t qualify even as eye candy to me.  Anyway, the challenge description was pretty clear it''s "sweet" candy.</td>', 'Um ... no.  That is, it''s an interesting picture, but it doesn''t qualify even as eye candy to me.  Anyway, the challenge description was pretty clear it''s "sweet" candy.', '2007-09-15 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4092533, 581200, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I just don''t like this.  Although there seems to be an orange tint to everything, it''s really the subject matter that fails to grab me.</td>', 'Sorry, but I just don''t like this.  Although there seems to be an orange tint to everything, it''s really the subject matter that fails to grab me.', '2007-09-15 22:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4092534, 584511, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah ... sweet music. ;)</td>', 'Ah ... sweet music. ;)', '2007-09-15 22:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4092540, 584767, 60862, '<td valign="top">Life is short - eat dessert first!  I like the idea, but it seems a bit dark (my CRT monitor is calibrated).</td>', 'Life is short - eat dessert first!  I like the idea, but it seems a bit dark (my CRT monitor is calibrated).', '2007-09-15 22:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4092550, 584506, 60862, '<td valign="top">The challenge description clearly said "sweet" candy.  I have a feeling you''ll score well, but that saddens me.  It''s nice, though, as an abstract outside of the challenge.</td>', 'The challenge description clearly said "sweet" candy.  I have a feeling you''ll score well, but that saddens me.  It''s nice, though, as an abstract outside of the challenge.', '2007-09-15 22:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
