(4092555, 583667, 60862, '<td valign="top">Please turn off your date function.  Aside from that, this is a cute idea, but the contrast and focus could be better.  Also, read the tutorial on how to resize images for DPC - you lose a lot of impact by not using the full size of 640 pixels on at least one side: //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26</td>', 'Please turn off your date function.  Aside from that, this is a cute idea, but the contrast and focus could be better.  Also, read the tutorial on how to resize images for DPC - you lose a lot of impact by not using the full size of 640 pixels on at least one side: //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26', '2007-09-15 22:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4092556, 583743, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but it''s lacking zing.  Maybe more contrast would help.</td>', 'Nice composition, but it''s lacking zing.  Maybe more contrast would help.', '2007-09-15 22:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
