(4092968, 583694, 53316, '<td valign="top">Maybe would have been better without the pink one, but still a 10 in my book.  I love the contrast between big and small (and these are pretty small candies themselves!) and the sharpness in the different parts of the image.</td>', 'Maybe would have been better without the pink one, but still a 10 in my book.  I love the contrast between big and small (and these are pretty small candies themselves!) and the sharpness in the different parts of the image.', '2007-09-16 03:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
