(4095016, 584590, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m not partial to candy sprinkles, but my God that ice cream looks tasty.  Excellent food photography, and the choice of color for the background is a perfect color for the theme, though the backdrop gets a bit dark at the top.  Great clarity, lighting, and melt control! :-)</td>', 'I''m not partial to candy sprinkles, but my God that ice cream looks tasty.  Excellent food photography, and the choice of color for the background is a perfect color for the theme, though the backdrop gets a bit dark at the top.  Great clarity, lighting, and melt control! :-)', '2007-09-17 00:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
