(4095330, 584740, 60862, '<td valign="top">Rob:  I gave this a 4.  But that''s specifically because it didn''t say much to me about "candy."  As a photo in general, or indeed as artwork, it''s more interesting visually than that score.  I like the white vs. black dichotomy, and the slight variation in the background is also good.<br/> <br/>Finally, I really like visual surprises, so to me this would improve hugely if you cropped off most of what''s to the right of the candy, putting it in the lower right corner.  Then, as my eye scans trying to figure out where the subject is, I find it wwaaayyy down there.</td>', 'Rob:  I gave this a 4.  But that''s specifically because it didn''t say much to me about "candy."  As a photo in general, or indeed as artwork, it''s more interesting visually than that score.  I like the white vs. black dichotomy, and the slight variation in the background is also good. Finally, I really like visual surprises, so to me this would improve hugely if you cropped off most of what''s to the right of the candy, putting it in the lower right corner.  Then, as my eye scans trying to figure out where the subject is, I find it wwaaayyy down there.', '2007-09-17 01:54:37.000000', NULL, 0),
