(4098947, 584382, 70270, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you beat me by one place with this shot.  What were the voters thinking?  This one was worth a 5.4321 at best.  Give me a break!<br/> <br/>lol -- nice shot. Nice to have a crosseyed model available in your bag of tricks.</td>', 'I can''t believe you beat me by one place with this shot.  What were the voters thinking?  This one was worth a 5.4321 at best.  Give me a break! lol -- nice shot. Nice to have a crosseyed model available in your bag of tricks.', '2007-09-18 13:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4098956, 584740, 62318, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a very well done photo. I love the two contrasting colors. Seems just a tad unsharp, but maybe it is my aging eyes. Simplicity works wonders and this is no exception. Personally, I think it is better than a big jar of candy.</td>', 'I thought this was a very well done photo. I love the two contrasting colors. Seems just a tad unsharp, but maybe it is my aging eyes. Simplicity works wonders and this is no exception. Personally, I think it is better than a big jar of candy.', '2007-09-18 13:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4098958, 584763, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression and nice framing. Just needs the other eye slightly more in the DOF range. Still, this is much better than the score would indicate. Green and red always make for a wonderful punchy combination.</td>', 'Wonderful expression and nice framing. Just needs the other eye slightly more in the DOF range. Still, this is much better than the score would indicate. Green and red always make for a wonderful punchy combination.', '2007-09-18 13:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4098973, 584382, 62318, '<td valign="top">It is funny. I love shots like this. Like the soft pink tone with the purple. Wonderful detail and expression.</td>', 'It is funny. I love shots like this. Like the soft pink tone with the purple. Wonderful detail and expression.', '2007-09-18 13:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
