(4103080, 582492, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very, very beautiful. It''s difficult to capture that incredible, irridescent texture of the cat''s eyes... I love it!</td>', 'Very, very beautiful. It''s difficult to capture that incredible, irridescent texture of the cat''s eyes... I love it!', '2007-09-19 21:00:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4103089, 584122, 63269, '<td valign="top">Yep, should have scored higher. :) even though it was (imo) a stretch at meeting the challenge, this has really great technicals. Some of the images that placed before it didn''t meet the challenge at all and were... um, not very good shots. I guess it got bombed because it''s not an appealing subject, to say the least. Silly voters... :)</td>', 'Yep, should have scored higher. :) even though it was (imo) a stretch at meeting the challenge, this has really great technicals. Some of the images that placed before it didn''t meet the challenge at all and were... um, not very good shots. I guess it got bombed because it''s not an appealing subject, to say the least. Silly voters... :)', '2007-09-19 21:06:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4103225, 584771, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol a bouquet of tootsie pops... <br/> <br/>I can see someone saying this now "happy anniversary, sucker!" hehe</td>', 'lol a bouquet of tootsie pops...  I can see someone saying this now "happy anniversary, sucker!" hehe', '2007-09-19 22:02:57.000000', NULL, 0),
