(4103872, 584122, 65069, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Haneck:</b></div><hr/><i> Yep, should have scored higher. :) even though it was (imo) a stretch at meeting the challenge, this has really great technicals. Some of the images that placed before it didn''t meet the challenge at all and were... um, not very good shots. I guess it got bombed because it''s not an appealing subject, to say the least. Silly voters... :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>oh, it''s totally a stretch.  i don''t even mind the brown ribbon....just don''t tell me that it''s a bad photograph!</td>', 'Originally posted by Haneck: Yep, should have scored higher. :) even though it was (imo) a stretch at meeting the challenge, this has really great technicals. Some of the images that placed before it didn''t meet the challenge at all and were... um, not very good shots. I guess it got bombed because it''s not an appealing subject, to say the least. Silly voters... :)   oh, it''s totally a stretch.  i don''t even mind the brown ribbon....just don''t tell me that it''s a bad photograph!', '2007-09-20 03:12:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4103946, 584773, 69462, '<td valign="top">I too would like to weigh in. Your photo is stunning. I especially like the way you framed it. In so far as eyes are so mesmerizing, it is brilliant that you framed it in a way to draw attention to the lips exclusively. The lips did not have to compete with your model''s eyes. Doing so would not have resulted in such a a strong impact.</td>', 'I too would like to weigh in. Your photo is stunning. I especially like the way you framed it. In so far as eyes are so mesmerizing, it is brilliant that you framed it in a way to draw attention to the lips exclusively. The lips did not have to compete with your model''s eyes. Doing so would not have resulted in such a a strong impact.', '2007-09-20 04:29:53.000000', NULL, 0),
