(4106406, 583812, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Love the softness, beautiful model and depth of field.  I''m surprised, however, that no one commented on the phallic nature of the particular candy chosen.  Given the sexy tones of the photo overall, I''d have a hard time believing that the phallic symbolism was accidental (not that there''s anything wrong with that!).  Or am I really just a guy with a dirty mind?  No, I don''t think so.  Nice pic.</td>', 'Wonderful image. Love the softness, beautiful model and depth of field.  I''m surprised, however, that no one commented on the phallic nature of the particular candy chosen.  Given the sexy tones of the photo overall, I''d have a hard time believing that the phallic symbolism was accidental (not that there''s anything wrong with that!).  Or am I really just a guy with a dirty mind?  No, I don''t think so.  Nice pic.', '2007-09-21 06:02:36.000000', NULL, 0),
