(4108631, 584767, 61818, '<td valign="top">Critique Club feedback -<br/> <br/>This is a nice entry that meets the challenge well.  Looks like you spent a good bit of time laying out your ''props'' with an eye for detail, and it paid off.<br/> <br/>The composition is interesting, though I find all the leading lines keep moving my eye quickly past the plate and on to that coffee cup.  <br/> <br/>The lighting is good, though the processing appears to have pulled the image back towards the dark side of things overall and the contrast is also slightly heavy.<br/> <br/>Again, its the attention to detail that really sets this shot apart.  The sprinkles on the milk, the placing of the strawberry - really great.  About the only thing missing here is a salt shaker full of chocolate powder and I think I''d be licking my screen!</td>', 'Critique Club feedback - This is a nice entry that meets the challenge well.  Looks like you spent a good bit of time laying out your ''props'' with an eye for detail, and it paid off. The composition is interesting, though I find all the leading lines keep moving my eye quickly past the plate and on to that coffee cup.   The lighting is good, though the processing appears to have pulled the image back towards the dark side of things overall and the contrast is also slightly heavy. Again, its the attention to detail that really sets this shot apart.  The sprinkles on the milk, the placing of the strawberry - really great.  About the only thing missing here is a salt shaker full of chocolate powder and I think I''d be licking my screen!', '2007-09-22 11:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4108638, 583994, 61818, '<td valign="top">Critique Club feedback -<br/> <br/>This is a very nice shot.  Good use of perspective to add interest and the depth of field works well with the subject.  I like how the jelly beans are the primary focus here, with a wealth of other goodies setting the scene.<br/> <br/>Overall it''s a fine shot and it received a good score to match.  Really the only thing that would keep the shot from scoring higher is some sort of excitement factor - a hand reaching into the jar, a person browsing the aisle - something to give it a spark of life.<br/> <br/>Again though, as it is this is a good shot and it placed well as it should.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Critique Club feedback - This is a very nice shot.  Good use of perspective to add interest and the depth of field works well with the subject.  I like how the jelly beans are the primary focus here, with a wealth of other goodies setting the scene. Overall it''s a fine shot and it received a good score to match.  Really the only thing that would keep the shot from scoring higher is some sort of excitement factor - a hand reaching into the jar, a person browsing the aisle - something to give it a spark of life. Again though, as it is this is a good shot and it placed well as it should. ', '2007-09-22 12:02:42.000000', NULL, 0),
