(4112733, 584048, 74559, '<td valign="top">I''ve never heard of flying saucers, but they actually sound very yummy to me since I like both rice paper and sherbet! For reasons I can''t explain in words, I am very drawn to this image. Guess it''s an emotional response; the pretty colors and pleasant shapes make me feel happy and peaceful and I cannot intellectually tell you why :-) Using the brain again, the lighting and colors are great, and I like your choice of DOF on this very wonderful composition. Sorry I didn''t vote in this one since I was out of town... should''ve placed higher IMO!</td>', 'I''ve never heard of flying saucers, but they actually sound very yummy to me since I like both rice paper and sherbet! For reasons I can''t explain in words, I am very drawn to this image. Guess it''s an emotional response; the pretty colors and pleasant shapes make me feel happy and peaceful and I cannot intellectually tell you why :-) Using the brain again, the lighting and colors are great, and I like your choice of DOF on this very wonderful composition. Sorry I didn''t vote in this one since I was out of town... should''ve placed higher IMO!', '2007-09-24 15:26:41.000000', NULL, 0),
