(4175723, 584713, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great place!!  You live in a very cool part of the country, apparently.  I suspect you used a flash here, yes?  It''s probably not light enough to shoot inside without a tripod.  If you did use flash, and you do have a tripod, you need to go back and try this again if they''ll let you.  I realize tripods are a pain in the butt.  I rarely carry one but have had times I wished I did.  I hear good things about monopods, which are much easier to carry and use, but haven''t tried one yet.  Anyway, there''s a lovely richness to the wood and the colors of the candy everywhere, and I suspect there are a whole lot of shots here still to be taken.</td>', 'What a great place!!  You live in a very cool part of the country, apparently.  I suspect you used a flash here, yes?  It''s probably not light enough to shoot inside without a tripod.  If you did use flash, and you do have a tripod, you need to go back and try this again if they''ll let you.  I realize tripods are a pain in the butt.  I rarely carry one but have had times I wished I did.  I hear good things about monopods, which are much easier to carry and use, but haven''t tried one yet.  Anyway, there''s a lovely richness to the wood and the colors of the candy everywhere, and I suspect there are a whole lot of shots here still to be taken.', '2007-10-17 14:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
